1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,518
Ren: If someone begs for help in a silent
place, stop.

2
00:00:04,188 --> 00:00:07,867
VALE & SON DISPATCH: The Quiet Hand. Part
six of ten: gus's list.

3
00:00:08,187 --> 00:00:10,647
Ren: Hour twenty-eight. Gus is gone.

4
00:00:11,317 --> 00:00:14,332
Ren: Footprints. One set. Dragged.

5
00:00:15,002 --> 00:00:16,884
Ren: The marks end at an RV park.

6
00:00:17,554 --> 00:00:21,834
Ren: The RV park. Lights off. Doors open.

7
00:00:22,504 --> 00:00:24,890
Ren: Six men. Three are not men.

8
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,025
Ren: One.

9
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:28,076
Ren: Two.

10
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:30,119
Ren: Three.

11
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,773
Marlow: You came alone. Of course you did.

12
00:00:34,443 --> 00:00:39,218
Gus: Ren. I had to. Six names. He holds my
daughter.

13
00:00:39,888 --> 00:00:43,144
Ren: Six names. Three crossed out. Mine is
one.

14
00:00:43,814 --> 00:00:46,269
Ren: Gus. A chair. A list.

15
00:00:46,939 --> 00:00:50,032
Ren: Cut the rope. Quietly. Count three.

16
00:00:50,702 --> 00:00:54,159
Ren: One hundred thirty-one. Walk. Do not
run.

17
00:00:54,829 --> 00:01:02,258
VALE & SON DISPATCH: Part six of ten, The
Quiet Hand. Next: the tower. Follow for part seven.

